					<paragraph lineSpacingSize="1.0"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[1. Any debts that have arisen and/or may arise after the time and date of issuance of this certification.
2. Any other debts related to the client’s current and investment accounts or obligations towards the bank and/or guarantees for third parties.
]]></text>
			</staticText>
