					<font fontName="Arial" size="12" pdfFontName="Arial" pdfEncoding="Identity-H" isPdfEmbedded="true"/>
					<paragraph lineSpacingSize="1.0"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[• Any alterations or erasures invalidate this certification.
• This certification is invalid unless stamped with the bank's official seal.
• This certification is valid for one month from its date of issuance.
• This document is not intended for the purpose of purchasing indebtedness from any financing entity
]]></text>
